WEBVTT

00:26:27.116 --> 00:26:30.956
RW: We are collecting more data,
even as we speak.

00:26:30.956 --> 00:26:35.036
We are collecting more information
from the children.

00:26:35.076 --> 00:26:37.916
Almost all the original
participants have passed away,

00:26:37.916 --> 00:26:40.916
but their children are all
Baby Boomers, on average.

00:26:40.956 --> 00:26:43.436
And so we're collecting information,

00:26:43.476 --> 00:26:47.356
including about what life was like
during the pandemic.

00:26:47.916 --> 00:26:51.876
Also collecting information
about how they use social media,

00:26:51.876 --> 00:26:54.876
which is something we've all been
talking about a bit here.

00:26:56.356 --> 00:26:58.876
And I think in terms of the future,

00:26:58.916 --> 00:27:03.396
we see ourselves as wanting
to make our data available